[{"client_msg_id":"a3028528-6da0-4238-88a6-f76b0b4c6e85","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"deno に deno 用のマーカー的なものがあれば全て解決するんですけどねぇ。","ts":"1617116002.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CeEXI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31913e13-13de-4ad8-b69f-7406d255332d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"微妙ですねぇ。オフったら今朝みたいな事故には気づかないし…。","ts":"1617115978.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n5JS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f59d690-c14c-4f2b-bb44-60b0a0592328","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"lsp-settings 用のデバッグフラグかなぁ。","ts":"1617115709.042900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mMru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0f59aa0-cde4-461f-b7c1-26eb05a08226","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"node なプロジェクトでやっぱ deno のメッセージが Vim 起動のたびに出るのやっぱ気になるなぁ。vimrc で blocklist を上書きすればいいけど、なにこれって声は上がるかも。\nとりあえず README に注意書き書くかな。","ts":"1617115630.042800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YckJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9eba674-fd74-49b2-8c22-34c6b1028611","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"完全にお前の環境が悪い問題が起きて辛い。TS 環境を lazy loading してて tsuquyomi 起動する前に deno 起動しててメッセージ消すのを差し込めないや。TS の lazy load やめるしかないのかなぁ。","ts":"1617107239.040300","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1617107287.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iqBYn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d89407c-e8b3-4383-99b2-b79a9875c8f7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"はい。","ts":"1617069656.036300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y/tX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc067929-edc2-4e3c-a641-0ce2a9b089d3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"割とハマりどころなので、ユーザーが適切に設定しろでもいいのかなぁと思いました。ただゼロコンフにしたいという気持ちもあって難しいですね :cold_sweat:","ts":"1617069069.036200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ASm/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d27c8c4-4eec-4426-ac26-9841facc1b57","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これは動かない方の悪い体験の方が影響大きそうだったので。","ts":"1617068966.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vOHy7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7735e8bc-ae11-4441-b3d1-c3cf18e4061b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あ、了解です","ts":"1617068945.033700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7HV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2cc4660-5db5-4354-8175-94becea68686","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"触ってみてうっとうしそうなら意見ください。","ts":"1617068941.033600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4opl8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7992d113-7bd4-435e-b16b-14defcc4fd2b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"応急処置でメッセージ出すようにしちゃいました。","ts":"1617068928.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"96Id"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a357411b-dd42-42ac-ab4d-7d58b3e59e9b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、たしかに","ts":"1617068924.032800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M1L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1609e075-7fc7-44d9-9151-3f7f6ba3de64","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちょっと夜にでもメッセージ出せるか確認してみます :cat-salute:","ts":"1617068916.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t46iL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0f2c75a-0309-41f4-b181-6ec1bcca3758","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"うーん。割と毎度出たら鬱陶しそうな気もw deno 入れてて node_modules があるところは動かないって動作をわかってる人は「知っとるわ！」ってなりそうな気もw","ts":"1617068888.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bFz5i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"580b233c-482b-4145-a708-2cfb62721a26","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"とりあえず deno だけ応急処置。","ts":"1617068883.031600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8AO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb7ced8e-3793-4881-a372-b8079021fc76","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"disableがサイレントなのもあるし、enableはstatusでいいけど...","ts":"1617068766.029700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h1O57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"772690a1-334d-4874-8d9c-a6196b53f957","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"むしろ、denoが悪さしてない(語弊がある)のがわかる意味で、通常でも出てほしい人もいそう...\nvarboseもですが、enable/disableだけは別途詳細出す/出さないのフラグがあってもいいかも","ts":"1617068743.029200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ep1WX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccc79ac1-3ecb-4c78-8f86-c30c22ce660d","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"g:lsp_log_verbose = 1 の時とかかなぁ。","ts":"1617068642.028100","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1617068648.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rmBQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41dfcd96-958a-4db5-948a-b6a0a2c0fdb0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうですねぇ。ただ通常の node の開発の時にもメッセージでないかちょっと心配ですねぇ。","ts":"1617068621.027800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YIGR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1db34da-d80c-4c60-84d0-df485408e0d9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u0026gt; server \"deno\" is disabled since node_modules is found at `/path/to/node_modules`.","ts":"1617068341.026600","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1617068377.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qGoKw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7aaee980-2eed-431c-b125-7fdfae93f6cc","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いえ、これ僕のミスなので。やるとしたらメッセージを出すくらいかな。","ts":"1617068319.026100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bXZh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50e97aeb-364c-458d-a78f-446b20308734","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、node開発下でdenoが文句いってきても、それはそれで困るだろうし","ts":"1617068123.025700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Zg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9C969433-3CC3-4FC5-8898-DE36323B0EEC","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"Blocklistやめた方が良いのかなぁ…","ts":"1617068057.025100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hDe7J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1874c4f-3ba1-4e55-9dc6-01630c9aa7ff","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"しかもモリモリやないか。","ts":"1617066690.024300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KH/NL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37090006-94c4-471d-8551-f4cc91209bae","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`C:\\dev\\deno-dev` で作業してたら `C:\\dev` に `node_modules` が置いてあったというオチ。誰やねん作ったの。","ts":"1617066635.024000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dRhT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbc447d3-8af5-4040-9dc6-9743ea5bdae0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あーっ、いや僕のミスでした。すいません。","ts":"1617066582.023400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tz6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21fdf37a-27eb-450f-a14f-bf209b137c1f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Windows だとカレントディレクトリが返るぽくて deno が起動してないみたい。","ts":"1617066453.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_i